    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take an almost 15 min. train coaster ride through a colorful island called Sunny Shores, home of the Bubblers character. See the homes that blow bubbles, watch the Bubblers fly in their balloons, aircraft and rocket surfboards. Go through 4 rooms with large bouncing balls hitting geometric sculptures. Watch the Bubblers go through their own rides throughout the island and see where they live. Catch a 75 ft gliding wave with them. Plunge down a 1,000 ft drop when the train attaches itself to wings and soar through an obstacle course of fun.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
